---
---
<section id="problem" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
            Your Voicemail is Where <br>
            <span class="text-red-500">Money Goes to Die.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-16">
            Every missed call is a job going to your competitor. You’re good at what you do, but you can’t be everywhere at once.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="glass-card border-red-500/20 hover:border-red-500/50 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-red-500 text-3xl mb-4">📉</div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">The Pain</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">You're deep in a job, phone rings. You ignore it. That was a $5,000 bathroom reno gone to the next guy on Google.</p>
            </div>
             <!-- Card 2 -->
             <div class="glass-card border-yellow-500/20 hover:border-yellow-500/50 transition-colors">
                <div class="text-yellow-500 text-3xl mb-4">🔁</div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">The Struggle</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">You spend your nights playing phone tag, returning missed calls, and drowning in admin instead of relaxing.</p>
            </div>
             <!-- Card 3 -->
             <div class="glass-card border-neon/20 hover:border-neon transition-colors relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-16 h-16 bg-neon/10 rounded-bl-full"></div>
                <div class="text-neon text-3xl mb-4">🚀</div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">The Fix</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">We clone your best day. Our AI answers instantly, qualifies the lead, and books the time. You just show up.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
